# Get Item Documentation

Retrieve documentation for a specific list item.

## Response Example

```json
{
  "listItemId": "47e56245-0a78-4cb9-a268-83fa2f247d91-01",
  "listRouteId": "47e56245-0a78-4cb9-a268-83fa2f247d91",
  "accountBuid": "4022a1aada0e4c4684e61e3f73290a68",
  "timestampEpochSecond": 1669118402,
  "notes": ["note 1", "note 2"],
  "images": [
    {
      "url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/...",
      "type": "signature",
      "position": {
        "latitude": 38.003654,
        "longitude": -121.783137
      }
    }
  ],
  "eventCode": {
    "code": "101",
    "name": "received"
  },
  "tags": [
    {"key": "is_in_time", "value": "true"}
  ]
}
```

## Image Types

| Type | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `proof` | Photo proof of delivery |
| `signature` | Customer signature |
| `exception` | Exception/issue documentation |
